WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,230
It’s the time of the Han attack again

2
00:00:04,590 --> 00:00:06,190
Everyone in your team has my bag.

3
00:00:06,350 --> 00:00:07,630
The looted materials are 50/50

4
00:00:07,910 --> 00:00:08,830
The premise is

5
00:00:08,950 --> 00:00:11,270
The conquered city rules me

6
00:00:13,130 --> 00:00:14,250
5 points for supplies is no problem

7
00:00:15,010 --> 00:00:17,050
But if the city is defeated, it will all be yours. This is not okay.

8
00:00:17,490 --> 00:00:21,610
Then form an alliance to be independent of each other, not interfere with each other, and only attack together.

9
00:00:21,730 --> 00:00:22,770
Let's live together after entering the city

10
00:00:22,890 --> 00:00:25,680
I will give you all the coins from your allies for this rice.

11
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:27,000
A pound of life

12
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:30,920
I sold it to you and raised it in a base. What about this one?

13
00:00:32,090 --> 00:00:34,170
Lu Qilin said you have the truth, Jing Huaye

14
00:00:34,620 --> 00:00:37,660
I finally met today. What is the name of our alliance?

15
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:41,440
Alliance is left
